; fas9_sections.scr - facit for step 9.12 (SECTIONOBJECT, SECTION_MANAGER, SECTION_SETTINGS; F9.16). Run it with
;   python -I tools/fas9_facit_run.py doc/facit/fas9_sections.scr
; (AutoCAD 2025's core on acad.dwt, a new empty drawing). Plain AutoCAD commands, no LISP; see fas9_example.scr.
; An empty line is Enter (it ends -LAYER, the drawn line of a section and the selection of CHPROP): none is left between
; the commands, or AutoCAD repeats the last command.
;
; What the core has: SECTIONPLANE (the command line form: Draw section / Orthographic / Type, then for a slice, a boundary and a
; volume a point and a through point), CHPROP, MOVE, ROTATE, MIRROR, ERASE, -LAYER, BOX. Draw section asks for its points and
; the point in the direction of the section view. Every section AutoCAD makes here has SECTION_SETTINGS with 90 2 and 91 0 (no
; settings of a type), and the SECTION_MANAGER lists none (70 only).
;
; Not made here (no command in the core; plan 9.12, "Ej testat", F9.16):
;   - SECTIONPLANEJOG, LIVESECTION, SECTIONPLANETOBLOCK and SECTIONPLANESETTINGS: the core knows the names but needs a
;     picked section object or a dialog (SECTIONPLANEJOG ends at "Select section object": a point does not pick the
;     indicator, Last is refused): a section with a jog after it was drawn, a live section (a manager that lists sections, 90
;     and 330), settings of a type (SectionTypeSettings with its geometries: Autodesk's reference and the old plan's B.67
;     only) and a section turned into a block have no AutoCAD file here
;   - the indicator's color and transparency (properties of the section object itself; CHPROP changes the entity's color)
; The saved states are one change apart, as the register's pairs ask: the last section made is the one that is changed.
_.-LAYER
_M
HDXF_SECTIONS

_.BOX
70,160,20
@60,40
40
_.SECTIONPLANE
_D
20,160,0
70,160,0
70,185,0
120,185,0

100,0,0
_.-LAYER
_M
HDXF_SECTIONS_B

_.SECTIONPLANE
_D
70,120,0
70,200,0

100,0,0
_.-LAYER
_M
HDXF_SECTIONS_C

_.SECTIONPLANE
_T
_S
0,0,0
100,0,0
_.SECTIONPLANE
_T
_B
0,220,0
100,220,0
_.SECTIONPLANE
_T
_V
0,400,0
100,400,0
;EXPECT SECTIONOBJECT SECTION_MANAGER SECTION_SETTINGS
;SAVE sections
_.CHPROP
_L

_LA
HDXF_SECTIONS

;SAVE sections layer_changed
_.CHPROP
_L

_C
1

;SAVE sections color_changed
_.MOVE
_L

0,0,0
10,10,5
;SAVE sections moved
_.ROTATE
_L

0,0,0
30
;SAVE sections rotated
_.MIRROR
_L

0,100
100,100
_N
;SAVE sections mirrored
_.ERASE
_L

;SAVE sections one_erased
_.ERASE
_ALL

;SAVE sections all_erased
